## Part C ├óÔé¼ÔÇØ Milestones

Each milestone: scope ├é┬À data ├é┬À code ├é┬À acceptance. Captures are native
1440├âÔÇö900 and 844├âÔÇö390 from `Catchline-sim` through `docs/tools/check.ps1`.
Every milestone adds its own `Assets/Editor/<Milestone>Checks.cs` and may
delete legacy suites it invalidates. Commit per milestone on `proto/deck-sim`.

### M0 ├óÔé¼ÔÇØ Speed model and cleanup (1 session)
- Implement CARDS-AND-SPEEDS ├é┬º1 and ├é┬º4: one formula, delete `CrewWorkSpeed`,
  `DeckhandHandlingSpeed`, `CompactPickupTime`, `CompactStowTime`; captain
  skill 100. Pickup 0.5 s, stow 0.6 s everywhere.
