source |

Invoke Impeccable as `/impeccable <command>` (Claude and Codex) or `$impeccable <command>` (Codex).

## The loop

1. Read `DESIGN.md` / `PRODUCT.md` (create them with Impeccable if missing and the task is design work).
2. Build in the existing codebase, toward the brief and the bar Mo set.
3. After every visual pass, screenshot at 1440├âÔÇö900 and 390├âÔÇö844 (add 768 when layout changes) and actually 
inspect the images.
4. Run `impeccable critique` and `impeccable audit`; fix what matters; repeat 3├óÔé¼ÔÇ£4 until nothing material is 
left.
5. Finish with `impeccable polish`, a `web-design-guidelines` review, a Lighthouse run and a clean console.
6. Update `DESIGN.md` if the visual system changed.

